{"id":55245,"date":"2026-07-28T17:35:23","date_gmt":"2026-07-28T16:35:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/tor-des-geants-tor\/"},"modified":"2026-09-02T19:40:06","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T18:40:06","slug":"tor-des-geants-tor","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/tor-des-geants-tor\/","title":{"rendered":"Tor des G\u00e9ants (TOR330) 2026 \u2013 Vale de Aosta"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Tor des G\u00e9ants (TOR330) 2026 \u2013 Vale de Aosta<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O lend\u00e1rio <strong>Tor des G\u00e9ants\u00ae 2026 (TOR330)<\/strong> realiza-se entre <strong>13 e 19 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, tendo como epicentro a m\u00edtica vila alpina de <strong>Courmayeur<\/strong>, na deslumbrante regi\u00e3o do <strong>Vale de Aosta (It\u00e1lia)<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>VDA Trailers SSDrl<\/strong>, o TOR330 \u00e9 universalmente reconhecido como uma das mais duras, prestigiadas e fascinantes provas de Endurance Trail do planeta.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida no domingo \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong> em Courmayeur, os atletas enfrentam uma odisseia monumental de <strong>330 km e 24.000 metros de desn\u00edvel positivo acumulado<\/strong> num limite m\u00e1ximo de <strong>150 horas<\/strong>, percorrendo em semi-autossufici\u00eancia as duas &#8216;Altas Vias&#8217; do Vale de Aosta sob o olhar imponente dos quatro gigantes dos Alpes: Monte Branco, Cervino, Monte Rosa e Gran Paradiso.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">13 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Courmayeur, Valle d&#8217;Aosta, It\u00e1lia<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">330 km com 24.000m D+ (Endurance Trail)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">VDA Trailers SSDrl<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">150h00<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Endurance Trail<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">TOR330 &#8211; Tor des G\u00e9ants\u00ae<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 13 Set \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 24000m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Tor des G\u00e9ants 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre de 13 a 19 de setembro de 2026, com partida e chegada em Courmayeur, na regi\u00e3o aut\u00f3noma do Vale de Aosta, nos Alpes italianos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia, altimetria e tempo limite da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O TOR330 conta com 330 km de extens\u00e3o, cerca de 24.000 metros de desn\u00edvel positivo acumulado (+24.000m D+) e um tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 150 horas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona a log\u00edstica de bases de vida e descanso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza 6 grandes Bases de Vida ao longo do percurso (com alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o quente, balne\u00e1rios, massagens e apoio m\u00e9dico), cabendo a cada atleta gerir livremente os seus tempos de paragem e sono.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os principais maci\u00e7os montanhosos percorridos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso contorna as quatro montanhas mais altas dos Alpes com mais de 4.000 metros de altitude: o Monte Branco (4810m), o Cervino\/Matterhorn (4478m), o Monte Rosa (4634m) e o Gran Paradiso (4061m).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o processo de pr\u00e9-inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As pr\u00e9-inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se em fevereiro na plataforma oficial TORX Experience, havendo sorteio de vagas e acesso priorit\u00e1rio para atletas PAX finishers de provas do circuito internacional TORX.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Tor des G\u00e9ants (TOR330) 2026 \u2013 Vale de Aosta\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-13\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Courmayeur, Valle d'Aosta\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Courmayeur\", \"addressRegion\": \"It\u00e1lia\", \"addressCountry\": \"IT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"VDA Trailers SSDrl\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Tor des G\u00e9ants 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento decorre de 13 a 19 de setembro de 2026, com partida e chegada em Courmayeur, na regi\u00e3o aut\u00f3noma do Vale de Aosta, nos Alpes italianos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia, altimetria e tempo limite da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O TOR330 conta com 330 km de extens\u00e3o, cerca de 24.000 metros de desn\u00edvel positivo acumulado (+24.000m D+) e um tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 150 horas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona a log\u00edstica de bases de vida e descanso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza 6 grandes Bases de Vida ao longo do percurso (com alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o quente, balne\u00e1rios, massagens e apoio m\u00e9dico), cabendo a cada atleta gerir livremente os seus tempos de paragem e sono.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os principais maci\u00e7os montanhosos percorridos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O percurso contorna as quatro montanhas mais altas dos Alpes com mais de 4.000 metros de altitude: o Monte Branco (4810m), o Cervino\/Matterhorn (4478m), o Monte Rosa (4634m) e o Gran Paradiso (4061m).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o processo de pr\u00e9-inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As pr\u00e9-inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se em fevereiro na plataforma oficial TORX Experience, havendo sorteio de vagas e acesso priorit\u00e1rio para atletas PAX finishers de provas do circuito internacional TORX.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":55246,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,622,499],"event_type_2":[627,1059],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-55245","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-courmayeur-italia","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-endurance","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-europa","event_type_2-italia"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/488902683_1082486410569829_7786875887009691739_n.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/55245","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=55245"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/55245\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":65749,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/55245\/revisions\/65749"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/55246"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=55245"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embe